   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s053-u008",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வசந்தி",
    "text": "No. First the child! Then Manoharan! His own jewel must be killed right before his eyes. Nurse! Go! Bring the child;",
