   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s053-u020",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Anna, break all those chains...... let me go, Mother!\n\n[She drags him into a room.]\n\nLet me go... let me go.",
